WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.238
Why only this one?

2
00:00:01.238 --> 00:00:05.926
The kit plans five items for Pass 2,
and four of them need more than files.

3
00:00:05.926 --> 00:00:08.406
One approver per authority class needs the

4
00:00:08.406 --> 00:00:11.162
catalog app's internals,
which aren't documented.

5
00:00:11.162 --> 00:00:15.625
Change records on demand need a
ServiceNow flow on a live instance.

6
00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:18.171
The SailPoint half of the evidence export

7
00:00:18.171 --> 00:00:20.862
needs event retention
nobody has confirmed.

8
00:00:20.862 --> 00:00:24.475
And email intake needs a
mailbox and an inbound action.

9
00:00:24.475 --> 00:00:28.920
The writer check needs only two
documented exports compared offline,

10
00:00:28.920 --> 00:00:30.980
so it can be built and tested now.
